---
/**
 * @component About.astro
 * @description "Whoami" section featuring a biographical summary and a profile avatar.
 * Uses a responsive layout strategy to optimize visual hierarchy across devices.
 * @dependencies Requires 'src/assets/images/profile.png' to exist.
 */
import profileImg from '../../assets/images/profile.png';
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-white/5">
  
  <h2 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-mono font-bold text-green-500 mb-12 uppercase tracking-tighter">
    > Whoami
  </h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
    
    <div class="flex-1 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-light text-base">
      
      <p class="mb-6">
        I started my journey into IT at 15, tinkering with microcomputer systems and networks. Curiosity led me to Web Development, but I quickly realized that my true endgame was <strong class="text-white font-normal">Cybersecurity</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="mb-6">
        Now at 20, I focus heavily on the <strong class="text-green-500 font-normal">Red Team</strong> side of operations. I thrive on the thrill of solving complex puzzles and understanding how systems break, though I also deeply enjoy the defensive strategy of Blue Teaming.
      </p>

      <p>
        Offline, I keep it simple. You’ll find me grinding video games (like the one in my picture), going gym, or spending quality time with my partner and friends. I’m just a guy who loves to learn, explore, and occasionally break things—ethically, of course.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="relative group shrink-0">
      
      <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-linear-to-r from-green-600 to-green-900 rounded-full blur opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-75 transition duration-1000 group-hover:duration-200"></div>
      
      <div class="relative w-56 h-56 md:w-80 md:h-80 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/10 bg-brand-bg">
        <img 
          src={profileImg.src} 
          alt="Avatar" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>